      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The value of this property is `nil` unless the looper’s [`status`](avplayerlooper/status-swift.property.md) changes to [`AVPlayerLooper.Status.failed`](avplayerlooper/status-swift.enum/failed.md).",
